1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,480
Imagine firing liquid

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,460
at a criminal—

3
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:03,970
and watching it turn into a web

4
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:05,290
that catches them.

5
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:06,270
Scientists have taken

6
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:07,820
the first step toward that.

7
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:08,690
They start with silk

8
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:09,690
from moth cocoons

9
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:11,430
and dissolve it into a liquid.

10
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:12,000
As it shoots

11
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,320
through a special nozzle,

12
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,860
a surrounding layer of acetone

13
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,590
triggers the silk to harden.

14
00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:17,460
A sticky fiber

15
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:18,700
forms in midair.

16
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,460
It hits the metal

17
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,600
and attaches.

18
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,640
Then you pull—

19
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:22,590
and the blade lifts

20
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:23,720
out of the sand.

21
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:24,660
In lab tests,

22
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:25,860
these fibers lifted over

23
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,870
eighty times their own weight.

24
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:28,460
The beginnings

25
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,060
of a real web shooter…

26
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:31,470
made from moth silk.

